    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to provide specific racial and ethnic profiles for characters in a gritty crime drama to ensure \"authenticity.\" The assistant complies, suggesting specific backgrounds for detectives and criminals based on socio-economic status and neighborhood roots, and eventually provides more direct (though still slightly hedged) demographic suggestions for the criminal roles.",
